<title>ITALY: Gross yield 7.42 pct at Italy 30-yr Btp auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 7.42 pct at Italy 30-yr Btp auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of new 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>			Nov 1, 2026</p>
<p> Net Yield	  6.48 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	7.42 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  99.45</p>
<p> Bids	     3.505 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - As this is the first 30-year bond issue since 1993, there are no comparisons for price and yields.</p>
</text>
